  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International conference on CC adaptation and ocean protection in VN</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This high-level international conference in Vietnam in 2020 aims to bring leaders, decision-makers, practitioners, scientists, experts, and communities together  to discuss the key challenges posed by climate change and pollution, identify opportunities to accelerate actions; share experiences, best practices and research results to enhance knowledge and encourage networking for South-South cooperation.</narrative>
  </description>
